      "message": "[error] Line 763: 🔴 `completeRecoveryIfReadyLocked()` is called with `callMutex_` already held, but it calls `stopCallRecovery()`, which locks `callMutex_` again. This can self-deadlock as soon as recovery completion conditions are met (e.g., from `onIceNegoSucceed`, `useRecoveredTransport`, or `followPeerTransport`). Fix by splitting `stopCallRecovery()` into a `_Locked` variant (no locking) for internal locked call paths, or by releasing the lock before calling it.",
      "revId": "c4cc24c04a72ab379edb574a25ec103d1ced9cee",
      "serverId": "1e26b4c1-6b8c-47ff-9df7-501b633d3b5a"
