      "message": " callMutex_  is a  std::recursive_mutex  in  src/call.h:467 .  completeRecoveryIfReadyLocked()  already holds it, and  stopCallRecovery()  reacquires it on the same thread, which a recursive mutex permits. It releases the inner acquisition on return; the outer lock is released by the caller. Splitting out a  _Locked  variant is not needed",
